{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d08d362fc1f1ddb255e9ccb989340ea7955d32e8dc90a83c7046f41a4f5a48e8", "ja": "（可奈の新しい衣装が完成した。試着も終わった\nみたいだし、様子を見にいってみようかな……）", "zh": "（可奈的新衣服做好了。试穿似乎也结束了，要不要去看看她的情况呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "006790702627edeee4d9a14c416ca81230174bb88fd4e0c2490beb52c408b2a5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです♪\nこの衣装、すっごくかわいいですね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦♪\n这套服装超级可爱的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "fc6982545675b3528138e7c7b152654e41c81032126ff6f97af90335345a0450", "ja": "レインコートがテーマだって聞きましたけど、\n水に濡れちゃっても大丈夫なんですか？", "zh": "听说主题是雨衣，不过就算被水淋湿了也没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ecf6a4e5705a9e03afadfb9ca32fc6c3c268214d72f8f3b0286d4fad29e14437", "ja": "ああ、一応な。作る時に防水加工をお願いしたから、\n大丈夫だとは思うけど……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "啊，姑且算是吧。制作时我拜托他们做了防水处理，\n应该没问题……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "03e984859fb0a3d3bca326b8bf63c20001048d68f834461515765772716c7329", "ja": "えっと……この衣装で雨の中を歩く姿を想像したら、\nなんだか楽しみになってきちゃって♪", "zh": "那个……一想到穿着这身服装走在雨中，就不知不觉开始期待起来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "93c9d0478fedf85fabe773217471544dfb91acf538ef68ca2db093666910b9f4", "ja": "早く雨が降らないかなって、ワクワクしてるんです。\n今から降ってきたりしないかな～？", "zh": "我正兴奋地等着雨快点下呢。\n现在就下起来会不会更好呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1006_p", "source_sha256": "727d5855d0487efe465c8578d886049fdeb3693d4ee98c9ce74435b4175bc999", "ja": "ははっ。雨が待ち遠しいって感じだな。\nそれにしても、可奈は雨が好きなのか？", "zh": "哈哈。感觉你都等不及要下雨了。\n话说回来，可奈喜欢下雨吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "9c6eb2cf011192e93868cb3a4817da45d6ebe9ce6763ac5f4877bfaf07b7c725", "ja": "うーん、荷物が濡れちゃうのは困りますけど……\nでも、好きな方かもしれません！", "zh": "嗯……行李被淋湿了确实会很伤脑筋，不过……\n但我可能还是喜欢下雨天吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "6734daaba1ca185ba9bde8471d536e6eae0d66ff0e306da7bbccf8d1df1d76b9", "ja": "だって、雨の日はいろんな音がありますから！", "zh": "因为下雨天会有各种各样的声音嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1009_p", "source_sha256": "58fbe844ff5130d8c84afca307bdd75eb0db2e5526734ec7cc737b8129cd083c", "ja": "いろんな音？", "zh": "各种各样的声音？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "9c02be800ca1d50825ef8fbfc35e81f8b9dc056cc7ac0acee8e79bdc6b2fcb0c", "ja": "はい！　雨が傘に当たる音とか、水たまりの音とか。\n雨の日にしか聞けない音があるんです。", "zh": "是的！比如雨滴打在伞上的声音，还有踩水洼的声音。\n有些声音只有在下雨天才能听到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "aad0b0159174b1f5e64bddede7069469b165ebba8d0faff269b0f7610dcd3c73", "ja": "雨のリズムに合わせて歌うと、\nなんだか合唱してるみたいで、すごく楽しいんです！", "zh": "配合着雨的节奏唱歌，总觉得就像在合唱一样，特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1012_p", "source_sha256": "79de1ac73a32cee6cb0f1ae61967df49a504c0c82889e4b83d1d88c0e261464d", "ja": "合唱か。可奈らしい表現だな。\nでも雨の中、楽しそうに歌ってる可奈が想像できるよ。", "zh": "合唱啊。很有可奈风格的表达呢。\n不过我都能想象出可奈在雨中开心歌唱的样子了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "8de573c6b5f30deed590e2477d5ae91a9d3ca2a9fb345e550239daf41a9197be", "ja": "雨……あーっ、{$P$}さん！\n私、いいこと思いつきました！", "zh": "雨……啊——，{$P$}先生！我想到一个好主意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "5749cb5ee8046a95b6288b47045b90b6e9b69a0338e04d90d59aaec5832ecbfb", "ja": "次の公演で雨を降らせませんか？　そしたら、\nファンの人達にも雨の楽しさが伝わるかもしれません！", "zh": "要不要在下一场公演里下雨？这样的话，说不定也能让粉丝们感受到雨天的乐趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5c2341fb58511731f0af1dd6af41720616d44c91aef1aabeabf7400c805f2219", "ja": "雨を降らせるって、ステージにか？", "zh": "让天降雨，是要在舞台上吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "2711cea0c32072e54723f6702f202a0e324c89f6d721d52eebb1d92cf93f167b", "ja": "はい♪　雨といっても、台風みたいなのじゃなくて、\nしとしとーって感じの雨ですよ！", "zh": "对♪ 虽然说是下雨，但不是台风那种暴雨，而是淅淅沥沥的细雨哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "7d74b7e0b5a7fe147302d99921f5e1c438d67b09c1dcadc4d32070e1f4463136", "ja": "せっかく、濡れてもいい衣装なんですから、\n少しくらい雨の中で歌っても平気ですよね♪", "zh": "难得这套服装就算被雨淋湿也没关系，在雨里唱一会儿应该也没问题吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f149f918c820b7f3af0470024db5129ca2a0b47db846b24667eb2dab4dc05d1c", "ja": "確かに、そうだな……。\nわかった。今後の公演で検討してみよう！", "zh": "确实，你说得对……。\n好，我会在之后的演出中考虑一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "0aabdc5f2e1f10f3d80439defad94bdb9a4eae359346fd7c66bb1758ddc4a19d", "ja": "雨と一緒に歌ったら～、素敵なステージになるから～♪\n降水確率100％～♪　可奈の元気も100％～♪", "zh": "和雨一起唱歌的话～，一定会成为精彩的舞台～♪降水概率100％～♪可奈的活力也是100％～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_036kan0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_036kan0374_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3bf96aa45be88f82c0f401d62766a2d3d440ec489ce7cde88040901b78f72644", "ja": "（ステージの演出はあとで考えるとして……。\n可奈の歌があれば、どんな天気も楽しく過ごせそうだ）", "zh": "（舞台演出之后再考虑也行……。\n只要有可奈的歌声，感觉无论什么天气都能快乐度过）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
